---
// Quiz figure for go-structs-methods-interfaces set 04: two interface values built from a pointer and from a value.
// It shows what each interface value holds; it does not say which assignments compile.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq04ic">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 290" role="img" aria-label="Interface Incrementer requires Inc(). Counter declares Inc with receiver c Counter. Interface value a holds type *Counter and a pointer to a Counter with n equal to 0. Interface value b holds type Counter and its own Counter with n equal to 0.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq04ic-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two Incrementer values and what they hold</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai giá trị Incrementer và thứ chúng giữ</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="10" y="36" width="560" height="56" rx="8" class="qfig-gq04ic-card" />
    <text x="26" y="60" class="qfig-gq04ic-c">type Incrementer interface&#123; Inc() &#125;</text>
    <text x="26" y="80" class="qfig-gq04ic-c">func (c Counter) Inc() &#123; c.n++ &#125;</text>

    <text x="20" y="130" class="qfig-gq04ic-c">a (Incrementer)</text>
    <rect x="20" y="140" width="250" height="44" rx="6" class="qfig-gq04ic-cell" />
    <line x1="145" x2="145" y1="140" y2="184" class="qfig-gq04ic-sep" />
    <text x="82" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-w">type</text>
    <text x="82" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-m">*Counter</text>
    <text x="207" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-w">data</text>
    <text x="207" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-m">pointer</text>
    <line x1="207" x2="207" y1="184" y2="212" class="qfig-gq04ic-sep" />
    <polygon points="201,208 213,208 207,218" class="qfig-gq04ic-head" />
    <rect x="140" y="220" width="135" height="44" rx="6" class="qfig-gq04ic-hot" />
    <text x="207" y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-w">Counter</text>
    <text x="207" y="255" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-m">n = 0</text>

    <text x="310" y="130" class="qfig-gq04ic-c">b (Incrementer)</text>
    <rect x="310" y="140" width="250" height="44" rx="6" class="qfig-gq04ic-cell" />
    <line x1="435" x2="435" y1="140" y2="184" class="qfig-gq04ic-sep" />
    <text x="372" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-w">type</text>
    <text x="372" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-m">Counter</text>
    <text x="497" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-w">data</text>
    <text x="497" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-m">value</text>
    <line x1="497" x2="497" y1="184" y2="212" class="qfig-gq04ic-sep" />
    <polygon points="491,208 503,208 497,218" class="qfig-gq04ic-head" />
    <rect x="430" y="220" width="135" height="44" rx="6" class="qfig-gq04ic-hot" />
    <text x="497" y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-w">Counter</text>
    <text x="497" y="255" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04ic-m">n = 0</text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq04ic { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq04ic svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq04ic text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq04ic .qfig-gq04ic-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq04ic .qfig-gq04ic-c { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq04ic .qfig-gq04ic-w { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq04ic .qfig-gq04ic-m { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq04ic-cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq04ic-hot { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 2; }
  .qfig-gq04ic-sep { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq04ic-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq04ic-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
</style>
